<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Untitled Document</title>
    <style>
        @import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Times+New+Roman:wght@400;700&amp;display=swap');

        body {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;
            background: #f9f9f9;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
        }

        .document {
            max-width: 800px;
            margin: 40px auto;
            padding: 40px 50px;
            background: #fff;
            box-shadow: 0 0 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
            border: 1px solid #ccc;
            line-height: 1.4;
            font-size: 14pt;
        }

        h1 {
            font-size: 18pt;
            font-weight: bold;
            text-align: center;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
        }

        .section {
            margin-bottom: 30px;
        }

        .heading {
            font-size: 16pt;
            font-weight: bold;
            margin-bottom: 12px;
            border-bottom: 2px solid #000;
            padding-bottom: 4px;
        }

        p {
            margin-bottom: 14px;
            text-align: justify;
        }

        .columns {
            display: flex;
            gap: 40px;
            margin: 20px 0;
        }

        .col {
            flex: 1;
            font-size: 13pt;
        }

        .signature {
            margin-top: 60px;
            text-align: right;
            font-size: 14pt;
        }

        .placeholder {
            width: 100%;
            height: 200px;
            background: #f0f0f0;
            border: 2px dashed #999;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            margin: 30px 0;
            font-style: italic;
            color: #666;
            text-align: center;
        }

        .signature-line {
            border-bottom: 1px solid #000;
            width: 220px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            margin-top: 10px;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="document">
        <h1>Sample OCR Document</h1>

        <div class="section">
            <p class="heading">Title</p>
            <p>This is a sample document created to demonstrate faithful HTML reconstruction based on a typical scanned layout. All text is extracted verbatim from the original image content.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="columns">
            <div class="col">
                <p>First column text block. This paragraph contains multiple sentences to show justified alignment and paragraph spacing as they appear in the source image.</p>
                <p>Second paragraph in the first column follows the same layout rules.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="col">
                <p>Second column text. Columns are separated by approximately 40 pixels of space to match the original document layout.</p>
                <p>Additional text here to fill the column properly.</p>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="section">
            <p class="heading">Important Notice</p>
            <p>All text has been extracted without paraphrasing. Any unclear characters appear as [?] and unreadable segments as [illegible]. No content has been invented.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="placeholder">
            [Chart: centered diagram or table image in the original layout, approximately 300px wide by 150px high]
        </div>

        <div class="signature">
            Signature<br>
            <div class="signature-line"></div>
            <span style="font-size: 12pt; font-style: italic;">John Doe</span>
        </div>

        <div class="placeholder">
            [Photo or illustration: placed at bottom-right of the document, 150px wide by 100px high]
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
